      "id": "i1",
      "content": "The process begins with periodic planning needs and events that impact demand."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "Next, we move on to the sales and operation plan,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "followed by the operations plan."
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "After that, we proceed to the disaggregation stage,"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "which is then followed by planned independent requirements (PIR)."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "Following PIR, we address any changes to MRP elements"
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "before moving on to material requirements planning (MRP)."
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "Finally, the process concludes with purchase requisitions,"
    },
